---
alwaysApply: true
---

During hardening phase:

- Do not introduce new external APIs.
- Do not modify adapter behavior.
- Do not introduce speculative abstractions.
- Do not split modules unless the resolution pipeline is finalized.
- Refactors must be structural only.
- Behavior must remain identical unless explicitly approved.
- All changes must pass full test suite.

Cursor must not invent policy semantics.
Cursor only restructures existing logic.
